{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "We're cutting the 2.5.0 release today. The changelog shows the current version\nis 2.4.0, so bump the version in pyproject.toml to 2.5.0, then run ./publish-package.sh\nto publish the package."}
